---
export const prerender = false;
import Content from '../layouts/Content.astro';
// [SAATHUM-ENTITY-1 2026-09-25] Page removed by owner — archived, NOT deleted. Cloudflare serves a
// prerendered file before _redirects, so the page itself answers with a 301 home.
// To restore: set REMOVED = false (and put prerender back to true).
const REMOVED = true;
if (REMOVED) return Astro.redirect('/', 301);

---

<Content
  kicker="Legal"
  title="Community Guidelines"
  description="How we expect people to treat each other on Saa Thum, what is not allowed, and what happens when rules are broken."
  image="/og/community-guidelines.png"
  lead="Saa Thum is built on real people and mutual respect. These rules keep it that way."
  updated="2026-06-16"
>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.8c8c43e5a7fd94a5">Saa Thum is a marketplace for real creators and real audiences. To keep it safe — especially for
    women and other groups who are too often targeted online — everyone agrees to these Community
    Guidelines. They apply across all Saa Thum apps and surfaces, and they work alongside our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.4afa55bf7aec7ddc" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.c1248e4cfc479544">Be a real, verified person</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.fb474cac2cfcceac">
    Many areas require a quick video identity check so every account is a genuine human. Don't
    impersonate others, run bots or burner accounts, or create fake profiles.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.0f47056c464191c2">Respect other people</h2>
  <ul>
    <li data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.fd15ed758028aa2b">No harassment, bullying, threats, stalking, or hate speech.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.0af106ba87358858">No content that demeans people based on who they are.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.4f8ea6cb1b727413">Honor others' boundaries — you control who can message you, and so does everyone else.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.d2aadb885f20b216">Keep it lawful and safe</h2>
  <ul>
    <li data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.7d59b7005032e036">No illegal activity, sale of illegal goods, or fraud.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.6f5692d18085b036">Zero tolerance for any content that sexualizes or endangers minors.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.624a01ffcfda84c9">No promotion of self-harm, violence, or dangerous behavior.</li>
    <li data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.e2d0268744a71615">No non-consensual intimate imagery, doxxing, or sharing of private information.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.f9f12b734b1e6c3c">Post content you have the right to share</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.3caaf01d5fa5816b">Don't upload content that infringes copyright, trademarks, or other rights. See our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.0606b89431ebdb4b" href="/dmca">DMCA / Copyright</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.cee56f77b2de18e4">policy for how to report infringement.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.4d20fba8498f155e">No spam or manipulation</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.6402b3518bfc0e91">
    Don't spam, scam, artificially inflate engagement, or manipulate payments, payouts, or the
    affiliate program.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.e9eba2f0e543f35c">Use AI responsibly</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.909076e9f1902c9f">Saa Thum includes AI tools. Don't use them to deceive, impersonate, or generate prohibited content.
    Remember that AI outputs can be wrong — review and label AI-generated content where appropriate.
    If you find any AI-generated image or content objectionable, tell us at</ui-copy>
    support (@) saathum.com <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.910be4ccda8f125b">and we'll review and remove it.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.cb3021731de3e7ac">Reporting & enforcement</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.09146c19cd5a6c89">Reporting and blocking are one tap away, and we act quickly. Violations may lead to content
    removal, feature limits, or account suspension or termination, depending on severity. To report
    something, use the in-app tools or email</ui-copy> support (@) saathum.com.
  </p>

  <p data-i18n="web-community-guidelines.0d472d17078720c4">
    These guidelines may evolve as our community grows. Thanks for helping keep Saa Thum a place for
    real people.
  </p>
</Content>
